rep("PimPam achieves a $22.5\\times$ average speedup over the GraphPi CPU framework for pattern matching. It needs partitioning schemes that fit each DPU's slice of the graph into its 64\\,MB bank~\\cite{cai2024pimpam}.",
"PimPam achieves a $22.5\\times$ average speedup over the GraphPi CPU framework for pattern matching~\\cite{cai2024pimpam}. Its four key optimizations are telling: load-aware task assignment, space-efficient parallel partitioning that fits each DPU's share of the graph into its 64\\,MB bank, adaptive multithreading, and dynamic bitmaps. Every one of them works around a constraint of the platform (limited per-core memory, no inter-core communication, weak in-order cores) rather than exploiting a property of the graph~\\cite{cai2024pimpam}.")
